  "process_fix": "a diff must report IN-PLACE CHANGES and SURFACE CHANGE as separate lines. A technically-true metric under a headline that implies something stronger is worse than no metric.",
  "the_actual_truth": "v1.1 DOES change semantics. It adds a GLOBAL explicit deny of s3:GetObjectVersion across all S3 for this principal, excepting only the enumerated resources. That is a real expansion of the deny surface, not an implementation detail.",
