  "why_it_was_misleading": "my diff computed that metric as 'statements present in BOTH versions whose content differs'. The new deny exists only in v1.1, so it was counted under ADDED and the counter honestly returned 0 for what it measured. But the LABEL reads as 'the policy's semantics did not change', which is FALSE: seven denies were added and one of them expands the deny surface globally."
 },
