 "why_the_statement_cannot_simply_be_narrowed": {
  "conclusion": "NotResource is the ONLY mechanism. 'Narrow the statement' is not an available option, so the real choice is to adopt the global restriction deliberately or to drop the explicit deny and accept implicitDeny for unregistered oos keys - which the registration forbids.",
  "condition_on_the_object_key": "S3 exposes NO condition key carrying the requested object key for GetObject/GetObjectVersion. s3:prefix is ListBucket-only; s3:ExistingObjectTag would require MUTATING the sealed holdout to tag it, which is unacceptable.",
  "goal": "deny s3:GetObjectVersion on (oos/* MINUS the six exact keys)",
  "resource_exclusion_operator": "does not exist in IAM"
 }
